    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        477,
        986,
        1950,
        1345
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "A significantly changed pattern in evening operations at the World Trade Center Terminal of the Port Authority Trans-Hudson (PATH), operating between Newark, Jersey City and Hoboken in New Jersey and Manhattan, provided the first indication that the Staggered Work Hours Program was achieving success.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 20,
          "mean": -0.2545,
          "min": -1.6347
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0006,
          "min": -0.0006
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 54,
          "mean": -0.0032,
          "min": -0.1258
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 3996,
        "area_px": 532475,
        "density": 0.0075,
        "chars": 301,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 75.33
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        477,
        1354,
        1950,
        1599
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Counts taken in October, 1971, showed that PATH's westbound travel in the peak 15 minutes from 5 to 5:15 p.m. is down by 1274 passengers (from 7498 to 6224), a congestion reduction of 17 percent since the program was instituted.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.2492,
          "min": -1.5719
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 74,
          "mean": -0.0026,
          "min": -0.1377
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 2288,
        "area_px": 364325,
        "density": 0.00628,
        "chars": 228,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 99.65
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        477,
        1599,
        1950,
        1844
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "The passengers shifted to earlier periods where greater capacity was available. Traffic in the 4:30 to 4:45 period, for example, jumped by some 53 percent from 3100 to 4746 passengers.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1409,
          "min": -1.5236
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 52,
          "mean": -0.0001,
          "min": -0.0034
        }
      },
      "ink": {
        "ink_px": 1971,
        "area_px": 364325,
        "density": 0.00541,
        "chars": 184,
        "chars_per_1k_ink": 93.35
      }
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        477,
        1844,
        1325,
        2155
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Such changes are very encouraging, since the project's chief aim is to provide improved levels of service on transportation systems.",
      "logprob_stats": {
        "bbox": {
          "n_tokens": 21,
          "mean": -0.1877,
          "min": -1.8027
        },
        "category": {
          "n_tokens": 1,
          "mean": -0.0,
          "min": -0.0
        },
        "text": {
          "n_tokens": 23,
